  "h1": [
    "Dr. Dmitriy Klass, DDS, MSD"
  ],
  "word_count": 368,
  "body_markdown": "Hackensack, NJ\n\nAbout\n\nAbout UsDr. Alan MeskinDr. Maurice SrourDr. Won-Sang LeeDr. Dmitriy KlassOur TechnologyOffice Gallery\n\nServices\n\nAll ServicesDental ImplantsSingle Tooth ImplantsAll-On-XSmile MakeoversFull Mouth RehabilitationImplant BridgeImplant RevisionEmergency Dental ServicesSedation DentistryCost of Dental ImplantsDental Implant FAQs\n\nPatient Stories\n\nPatient TestimonialsBefore & After\n\nNew Patient\n\nYour First VisitInsurance & FinancingDental Implant FAQsPre Op & Post Op InstructionsBlogs\n\nDoctor Referral\n\nContact\n\nSchedule Your Consultation\n\nSCHEDULE FREE CONSULTATION\n\nSchedule Consultation\n\n\n# Dr. Dmitriy Klass, DDS, MSD\n\n\nNYU-trained periodontist and implant surgeon with a Master of Science in Dentistry from Boston University. He specializes in advanced implant procedures, bone and gum grafting, and minimally invasive periodontal care.\n\n\n## Training & Surgical Background\n\n\nDr. Klass earned his Doctor of Dental Surgery degree from New York University College of Dentistry, where he was part of the Honors in Prosthodontics clinic and received the Carl E. Misch Award for Excellence at the Greater New York Dental Meeting World Implant Expo in 2018. He then completed his specialty residency in Periodontics and earned a Master of Science in Dentistry at Boston University’s Henry M. Goldman School of Dental Medicine. During his residency, he conducted one of the world’s first clinical trials evaluating the accuracy of a robotic dental implant system, research that was later published. That dual training in clinical periodontics and academic research gives him a deep foundation in how bone and gum tissue support long-term implant success.\n\nRecognized among Philadelphia's Top Doctors in 2025, Dr. Klass focuses on advanced implant procedures, gum and bone grafting, orthodontic acceleration, and regenerative treatment for periodontal disease. He uses the latest evidence-based, minimally invasive techniques to provide comfortable, high-quality care, and his work at Hackensack Center ensures that every implant is placed in a healthy, well-prepared foundation. Dr. Klass is board eligible.\n\nAdvanced dental implant procedures\n\nBone grafting and sinus augmentation\n\nGum grafting and periodontal regeneration\n\nMinimally invasive periodontal treatment\n\nNYU and Boston University Trained\n\nPeriodontist and Implant Surgeon\n\nPhiladelphia Top Doctor 2025\n\n\n### Reimagine your dental experience\n\n\n\n### address\n\n\n163 Main Street, Suite A1,\n\nHackensack, NJ 07601\n\n(551) 368-2476\n\n\n### Hours\n\n\nMonday - Friday: 10:00 AM to 6:00 PM\n\nSaturday - Sunday: Closed\n\n\n### LANGUAGES\n\n\nEnglish\n\nEspañol\n\nРусский\n\nPortuguese\n\nKorean\n\nServing Hackensack and the Greater Bergen County Area\n\nCopyright © 2026 Hackensack Center for Dental Implants\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nTerms of Service\n\nCookie Policy\n\nHIPAA Disclosure",
